"Start with quick wins. Discover what HRV means and build a simple, sustainable routine from day one." = "从快速收获开始，了解 HRV 的意义，并从第一天建立简单可持续的习惯。";
"Transform curiosity into a lasting habit. Small, consistent actions each day make your data more reliable." = "把好奇变成长期习惯。每天的小行动会让数据更可靠。";
"Create a personal baseline to make your insights meaningful. Resting measures data minimizes noise and guesswork." = "建立个人基线，让洞察更有意义。静息测量能减少噪声和猜测。";
"Sleep is your clearest signal. Morning and evening check-ins uncover recovery patterns and habits." = "睡眠是最清晰的信号。早晚测量能发现恢复模式和习惯。";
"Measure calmness. Before-and-after sessions reveal what truly helps you reset and recover." = "测量平静状态。前后对比能揭示什么真正帮助你恢复。";
"Link your training load to recovery. Tags and measure pairs help you avoid overtraining and stay consistent." = "把训练负荷与恢复联系起来。标签和配对测量帮助你避免过度训练。";
"Track stress without drama. Capture before, during, and after moments to discover what restores you faster." = "从容追踪压力。记录压力前、中、后，找出让你更快恢复的方法。";
"Focus on trends, not single spikes. Consistency and context make it easier to spot meaningful changes." = "关注趋势而不是单次波动。一致性和情境让变化更易识别。";
"Intentionally mix contexts. A broader view helps you fairly compare sleep, movement, stress, and calm." = "有意识地混合不同情境，更公平地比较睡眠、运动、压力和放松。";
"Balance rest, load, and daily activities. Better coverage makes short-term reactions more reliable." = "平衡休息、负荷和日常活动。更全面的覆盖让短期反应更可靠。";
"Think in seasons, not days. Systems and regular reviews help you sustain habits and maintain steady progress." = "以季节而非天数思考。坚持系统和定期回顾，帮助维持习惯和进步。";
"Master the long term. A year or more of consistent check-ins creates a personal reference you can rely on." = "掌握长期节奏。一年以上的持续记录会形成可靠的个人参照。";
